normalForm -- Represent a bracket polynomial in a normal form with respect to a Groebner basis
**********************************************************************************************

Description
===========

The relations between brackets generate an ideal, which are the classic Plücker
relations. A Groebner basis for this ideal allows one to represent a polynomial
in brackets in a unique normal form.

+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : B = bracketRing(4,2)                                         |
|                                                                  |
|o1 = B                                                            |
|      4,2                                                         |
|                                                                  |
|o1 : BracketRing                                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = [1 2]_B * [3 4]_B - [1 3]_B * [2 4]_B + [1 4]_B * [2 3]_B|
|                                                                  |
|o2 = [23]*[14]-[24]*[13]+[34]*[12]                                |
|                                                                  |
|o2 : GCExpression                                                 |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : normalForm(f)                                                |
|                                                                  |
|o3 = 0                                                            |
|                                                                  |
|o3 : GCExpression                                                 |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also *note Bracket: Bracket,, *note toBracketPolynomial:
toBracketPolynomial,, and *note bracketRing: bracketRing,

Ways to use normalForm:
=======================

  * "normalForm(GCExpression)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note normalForm: normalForm, is a *note method function:
(Macaulay2Doc)MethodFunction,.

